Z||000000||jhogans||03-17-2000||03:55 PM||||I have you guys heard about the I-Opener hack.  If not, here is the quick and dirty.  Netpliance and Circuit City are selling a small computer used to access the web for $99.  Somebody has hacked into this small computer and installed a 2.5" HD(laptop) and installed Windows 98 and Linux on it.  Now he has a small computer for less than $200.<P>Here are a couple of links.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.linux-hacker.net/iopener" TARGET=_blank>http://www.linux-hacker.net/iopener</A>  <A HREF="http://www.i-opener-linux.net" TARGET=_blank>http://www.i-opener-linux.net</A> <P>||||reg||1
